     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br>I found this jquery resizeable div component. I was wondering if anyone has any insights into how this can be incorporated into a shiny app?<br><a href=\"https://jqueryui.com/resizable/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://jqueryui.com/resizable/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397897631000&amp;usg=AOvVaw388k0oq4uNXdjd14yPkDZI\">https://jqueryui.com/resizable/</a><br>Thanks.<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pc3OnG7X3UsJ",
   "from": "Andrew Holguin",
   "author": "74752d38e7c87f7e",
   "date": "2015-07-06T20:25:10Z",
   "subject": "Re: Resizeable div",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Here is a simple example. I just wrapped a plot output element in a resizable div and then added a little extra code so that plot height will also update. If someone has another example, I would be interested in seeing it.</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.8999996185303px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;padding:16px;border-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal;word-break:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">library(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">shiny</span>)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">ui</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> bootstrapPage(\r\n  HTML(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;<a href=\"https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jqueryui/1.11.4/themes/smoothness/jquery-ui.css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jqueryui/1.11.4/themes/smoothness/jquery-ui.css&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397897633000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0shuWCtxew-X02NbWhjGQd\">https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jqueryui/1.11.4/themes/smoothness/jquery-ui.css</a>&quot;&gt;<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>),\r\n  HTML(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>&lt;script src=&quot;<a href=\"https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jqueryui/1.11.4/jquery-ui.min.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jqueryui/1.11.4/jquery-ui.min.js&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397897633000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jc5sRuVK66JzXiTAnJW_N\">https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jqueryui/1.11.4/jquery-ui.min.js</a>&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>),\r\n  numericInput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>Number of obs<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">200</span>),\r\n  div(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">class</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>resizable<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">style</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>border: 2px solid black;<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>,\r\n    plotOutput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>plot<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>)\r\n  ),\r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">tags</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span>script(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>$(&quot;.resizable&quot;).resizable({ stop: function () { $(&quot;#plot&quot;).height($(this).height()) } });<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>)\r\n)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(121,93,163)\">server</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">function</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">input</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output</span>) {\r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">plot</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> renderPlot({\r\n    hist(runif(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">input</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">n</span>))\r\n  })\r\n}\r\n\r\nshinyApp(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">ui</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">ui</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">server</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">server</span>)</pre></div></div>"
    ],
